  idQuest: 11
  tenNhiemVu: "Huy\u1EBFt S\xE1t Ngo\u1EA1i \xD4"
  loiThoaiNhanQuest: "\u0110\u1EA1i hi\u1EC7p h\xE3y c\u1EE9u gi\xFAp th\xF4n x\xF3m!
    D\u1EA1o g\u1EA7n \u0111\xE2y ma kh\xED b\xF9ng ph\xE1t khi\u1EBFn t\xE0n c\u1ED1t
    c\u1EE7a \u0111\xE1m th\u1EE3 s\u0103n t\u1EED n\u1EA1n \u1EDF Thanh Tr\xFAc
    L\xE2m bi\u1EBFn th\xE0nh qu\xE1i x\u01B0\u01A1ng tr\xE0n v\u1EC1 qu\u1EA5y nhi\u1EC5u
    d\xE2n l\xE0nh. Xin \u0111\u1EA1i hi\u1EC7p h\xE3y ra ngo\u1EA1i \xF4 ti\xEAu
    di\u1EC7t b\u1EDBt b\u1ECDn ch\xFAng!"
  loiThoaiDangLam: "L\u0169 qu\xE1i x\u01B0\u01A1ng v\u1EABn \u0111ang l\u1EA3ng
    v\u1EA3ng \u1EDF b\u1EDD r\xE0o ngo\u1EA1i \xF4, \u0111\u1EA1i hi\u1EC7p xin
    h\xE3y s\u1EDBm h\u1EA1 g\u1EE5c \u0111\u1EE7 5 con \u0111\u1EC3 d\xE2n l\xE0ng
    y\xEAn t\xE2m c\xE0y c\u1EA5y!"
  loiThoaiHoanThanh: "C\u1EA3m \u01A1n \u0111\u1EA1i hi\u1EC7p \u0111\xE3 ra tay
    tr\u1EEB h\u1EA1i! Nh\u1EDD c\xF3 ng\xE0i m\xE0 b\xE1 t\xE1nh xung quanh \u0111\xE2y
    \u0111\xE3 g\u1EB7t h\xE1i \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c ch\xFAt n\xF4ng s\u1EA3n trong
    b\xECnh an."
